  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all real values of <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> such that a plane passing through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> also passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math><mi>S</mi></math> is equal to :"
  },
